Greater-Equal             a >= b,  a => b
In-Range                  a in <b,c>, a in |b,c>, a in <b,c|, a in |b,c|
In-Array                  a in {b,c,...}, {a,b,...} in {c,d,...}
Bitwise-Or                a | b
Bitwise-And               a & b
Bitwise-Shift left        a << b
Bitwise-Shift right       a >> b
Bitwise-Invert            ~a
Bitwise-Xor               a xor b (operator ^ already used for power)
