Object Attribute          a.b, a.(b)
Post Increment            a++
Post Decrement            a--
Pre Increment             ++a
Pre Decrement             --a
Old String Function       #a
Conditional               a? b : c
Assignment                a = b, a := b
Additive Assignment       a += b
Substractive Assignment   a -= b
Multiplicative Assignment a *= b
