=Hosted Events= One of the main things to do on Delteria is participate in events and tournaments. Delteria currently has 13 events, some of which are the same with slight differences (such as theme). {| style="width:600px" |+ '''List of Events''' |- ! Skill !! Luck !! Race |- | Free-For-All || Chance || Chair Race |- | Free-For All 2 || Lucky Doors || Chair Race 2 |- | Jousting || Star Grab || Bush Race |- | || || Bush Race 2 |- | || || Water Race |- | || || Horse Race |- | || || Crate Race |}
