=Staff= This is '''only''' the higher-up staff, staff members in ''italics'' are considered server administrators. {| style="width:400px" |- ! Nick !! Position |- | ''[[User:Carlito|Carlito]]'' || ''Manager / PWA'' |- | ''[[User:Zerith|Zerith]]'' || ''General Manager'' |- | ''[[User:Shurikan|Shurikan]]'' || ''General Manager'' |- | ''[[User:Tore|Tore]]'' || ''Community Manager'' |- | [[User:Thor|Thor]] || ''Game Master Administrator'' |- | [[User:Zazzi|Zazzi]] || Asst. Game Master Administrator |- | [[User:Fae|Fae]] || Graphics Admin |- | [[User:PlayerLoL|PlayerLoL]] || Levels Admin |}
