==Introduction== Armour can be enchanted using Enchant Armour scrolls which can be used to improve the base value of stats on armours such as helmets, shields, cloaks, bracers, body armour, boots, and gloves. The only values that will improve are Weapon Class (wc), Armour Class (ac), and Damage (dam) improving by + 1 for each scroll, Armour is also increased with the use of the scrolls but increases by more than +1 with each scroll and to the max value of 90 on most items.
